        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Yanzhou District, Shangqiu\n- Administrative divisions: districts, county-level cities, prefecture-level cities, provinces\n- Names: Yenchow, Shangkiu, Jining, Shandong, Henan, China\n\nFacts:\n- Yanzhou, postalized as Yenchow, is a district under the administration of Jining in southwestern Shandong province, China.\n- Yanzhou was formerly a county-level city before becoming a district under Jining.\n- Shangqiu, formerly romanized as Shangkiu, is a city in eastern Henan province in Central China.",
